      "raw": "<p>Ra, Expatriette, and Visionary vs. The Matriarch in Insula Primalis. How to win? That order of characters, as I rather think it would be easier if you put Visionary first.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I&#39;ve suffered four massive defeats in a row. I&#39;ve tried just focusing fire on The Matriarch. I tried using Twist The Ether and Liquid Nitrogen Rounds to reduce The Matriarch&#39;s attacks, but amongst Horrid Cacophany, Huginn, and Primordial Plant Life, couldn&#39;t keep them in play. Same thing with Flame Barrier.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I had a great start once, with two useless Darken The Skies and a mostly painless Horrid Cacophany followed by Brain Burning The Mask. It wasn&#39;t enough. The Matriarch flipped and started healing when she was only down to the 40s for hit points, but the heroes were already in the low teens.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I tried carefully dealing with each threat as it came out, but of course that just meant that I did a ton of damage to Cohorts and Carrion Fields rather than The Matriarch.</p>",
