      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silopolis/{size}/2166_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-04-17T00:01:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I can't imagine how you could bet Matriarch without Tachyon, Haka, and someone like Tempest, Adept, or Sentinels with some healing mojo. Maybe Fixer for Grease Gun. Without a way to neutralize the damage you take for killing birds, I just can't see how you could win.</p><p>We've only played against her twice, but we won the second time, thanks to Tempest's Hypersonic Assault and Haka's Savage Mana keeping the mask and cohorts from coming back into play.</p>",
