      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Nielzabub wrote:</b><br><blockquote>If you're in a team of three and can get Stealth Bot out early, that really helps since it can cancel out the damage from the Carrion Fields and the Matriarch.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nNow what a trick that would be!It would be quite a good sight to seeto bring out a botwhen the team is notsupposed to include Unity.&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The trick is to put Stealth Bot in the environment deck. It gets played and can automatically start helping the heroes.</p>",
