      "id": 140163,
      "name": "arenson9",
      "username": "arenson9",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-04-17T13:12:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>twist, IF, hairtrigger, flesh. &nbsp;That'll crush matty.Twist turning all Matty's damage to fire, and ra sitting highest ignores all retaliation damage. &nbsp;Those 2 cards crush her.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Easier said than done, as it's hard to maintain those ongoings given Horrid Cacophany, but on my second try I managed it, helped greatly by an early Volcanic Erruption. Even so Visionary got knocked out and Ra and Expatriette were in single digits at the end. Speed Loading with a couple Liquid Nitrogen Rounds and the Submachine Gun were really useful, too.</p>",
