      "created_at": "2015-04-17T15:38:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>phantaskippy wrote:</b><br><blockquote>twist, IF, hairtrigger, flesh. &nbsp;That'll crush matty.Twist turning all Matty's damage to fire, and ra sitting highest ignores all retaliation damage. &nbsp;Those 2 cards crush her.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;Easier said than done, as it's hard to maintain those ongoings given Horrid Cacophany, but on my second try I managed it, helped greatly by an early Volcanic Erruption. Even so Visionary got knocked out and Ra and Expatriette were in single digits at the end. Speed Loading with a couple Liquid Nitrogen Rounds and the Submachine Gun were really useful, too.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That's the best bet, I think:&nbsp; Ra protecting everyone from fire then a Volcano doing all your dirty work.</p>\n<p>Also, off topic, but Visionary lowering enviornment damage is amazingly useful in the Rook City enviornments.</p>",
